{"id":"wb-5-439","name":"昭苏圣佑庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"圣佑庙","text":"圣佑庙，又称圣祐庙、圣祐寺等，汉语俗称喇嘛昭，蒙古语名博格达夏格松（卫拉特蒙古语：ᡋᡇᠷᡍᠠᠨᡋᠠᡎᠱᡅᡅᠨᠰᡉᡏᡄ Burxaa baγši-in süme），蒙古语俗称博格达伊瓦克齐苏木，藏语俗称吉金铃，位于新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州昭苏县昭苏镇，是新疆四大藏传佛教寺院之一，为格鲁派寺院。圣佑庙也是新疆现存规模最大、保存最为完整的藏传佛教寺院古建筑。同时还是全国重点文物保护单位。\n圣佑庙占地面积11900平方米，现存法舞殿（山门）、闭关殿（前殿）、钟鼓楼、东西配殿、大雄宝殿、后殿等8座建筑。圣佑庙采用汉藏结合的建筑造型，装饰上包含蒙、汉、藏建筑装饰风格的纹样。昭苏县之“昭”取自圣佑庙的俗称喇嘛昭的“昭”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E4%BD%91%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94238365,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94238365","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/39443d7a9fdfaee6f3da4a4a.jpg","title":"圣佑庙大雄宝殿_the_Main_Hall_of_Shengyou_Temple.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9C%A3%E4%BD%91%E5%BA%99%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF_the_Main_Hall_of_Shengyou_Temple.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/%E5%9C%A3%E4%BD%91%E5%BA%99%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF_the_Main_Hall_of_Shengyou_Temple.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​圣佑庙大雄宝殿","width":320,"height":213}}